    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd0d Step into a Mystery Full of Secrets and Surprises! \ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you enjoy solving puzzles and exploring spooky old mansions? This game invites you into the strange and unforgettable world of <i>The Fall of the House of Usher</i>, based on the classic story by Edgar Allan Poe. \ud83c\udff0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll play as a curious detective who stumbles into something way beyond the ordinary. What\u2019s going on with Roderick Usher, and why is the house filled with such strange energy? It\u2019s up to you to find out \u2014 one clue at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your sharp eye and love for solving mysteries to search through dark, mysterious rooms, uncover hidden secrets, and put the pieces together before it's too late! \ud83e\udde9</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore beautiful, atmospheric locations with lots of hidden objects and clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play again and again \u2013 items and puzzles change to keep things fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy unique 360\u00b0 panoramic scenes that really pull you into the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a fresh take on Poe\u2019s famous tale with added twists and surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect special rewards by completing scenes in different game modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a fan of hidden-object games, spooky stories, or just love a good mystery, this game offers a rich and enjoyable experience that keeps you thinking and guessing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f Your journey into the heart of mystery begins now\u2026 Will you unlock the secrets of the House of Usher? \ud83c\udf19</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd0d Step into a Mystery Full of Secrets and Surprises! \ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you enjoy solving puzzles and exploring spooky old mansions? This game invites you into the strange and unforgettable world of <i>The Fall of the House of Usher</i>, based on the classic story by Edgar Allan Poe. \ud83c\udff0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll play as a curious detective who stumbles into something way beyond the ordinary. What\u2019s going on with Roderick Usher, and why is the house filled with such strange energy? It\u2019s up to you to find out \u2014 one clue at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your sharp eye and love for solving mysteries to search through dark, mysterious rooms, uncover hidden secrets, and put the pieces together before it's too late! \ud83e\udde9</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore beautiful, atmospheric locations with lots of hidden objects and clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play again and again \u2013 items and puzzles change to keep things fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy unique 360\u00b0 panoramic scenes that really pull you into the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a fresh take on Poe\u2019s famous tale with added twists and surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect special rewards by completing scenes in different game modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a fan of hidden-object games, spooky stories, or just love a good mystery, this game offers a rich and enjoyable experience that keeps you thinking and guessing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f Your journey into the heart of mystery begins now\u2026 Will you unlock the secrets of the House of Usher? \ud83c\udf19</strong></h2>",
